# Paths TruffleHog skips in `just nightly` (regexes): the pin-file tests hold fixture URLs with an
# inline user and password that the URI detector flags. The file lists itself: its wording trips the
# detector too once committed (TruffleHog scans the history).
^\.trufflehog-exclude$
^src/main/domain/pin-file\.test\.ts$
